{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocator</strong> combines the unpredictability of a roguelike, the strategic planning of a board game, and the tactical depth of an autobattler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 unique Vocators</strong>, each with a powerful ability that shapes your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play from a roster of <strong>70 heroes</strong>, placing them on the board to boost your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reroll your servants' dice</strong> to land them on tiles occupied by  heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip <strong>86 artifacts</strong> that enhance heroes, empower servants, or alter core game rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover powerful synergies</strong> between heroes, artifacts, servants, and abilities to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>roguelike gameplay loop</strong>, uncovering new strategies and combinations with each run to overcome increasing challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a roguelike enthusiast, a fan of tactical autobattlers, or someone who loves strategic board games, <i>Vocator</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt fast, and master the mechanics.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682060?t=1747321326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682060/c20481f6486159ba54ca5a08de274cc6c9a036d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747321326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682060/43cd0e843b82097c82b6a5b813bfa7f8956b394b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747321326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682060/43cd0e843b82097c82b6a5b813bfa7f8956b394b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747321326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocator</strong> combines the unpredictability of a roguelike, the strategic planning of a board game, and the tactical depth of an autobattler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 unique Vocators</strong>, each with a powerful ability that shapes your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play from a roster of <strong>70 heroes</strong>, placing them on the board to boost your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reroll your servants' dice</strong> to land them on tiles occupied by  heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip <strong>86 artifacts</strong> that enhance heroes, empower servants, or alter core game rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover powerful synergies</strong> between heroes, artifacts, servants, and abilities to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>roguelike gameplay loop</strong>, uncovering new strategies and combinations with each run to overcome increasing challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a roguelike enthusiast, a fan of tactical autobattlers, or someone who loves strategic board games, <i>Vocator</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt fast, and master the mechanics.</p>","developers":["Ion Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682060/d6ff58b8a1072333a8336ddd7cfeabbd886bd6a3/header.jpg?t=1747321326","is_free":false,"linux